# Kobin AI — Feature Distribution Plan
> Based on full codebase exploration across all 50+ source files

---

## What's Actually In This Product

Before the tiers, here's every real feature mapped from the code:

| Module | Features Found in Code |
|---|---|
| **Tasks** | Buckets (today/this-week/delegated/backlog), priorities, statuses, due dates, deliverable requirements, vault file attachments, external link attachments, fuzzy assignment |
| **Projects** | Status (active/on-hold/completed/archived), priority, start/end dates, task counts, at-risk detection |
| **Calendar** | Full Google Calendar sync, Meet link generation, event invites, upcoming deadlines |
| **CRM** | 7-stage pipeline, deal values, lead scores (0–100), close probability %, stale deal detection (14+ days), weighted pipeline value |
| **Team** | Member management, workload scoring (FREE/LIGHT/MODERATE/HEAVY), active/overdue/blocked task counts, smart task delegation |
| **Client Portal** | Separate auth flow, client home, client task view, client vault (`client_uploads` + `deliverables` folders), client sidebar, approval/review flow on deliverables |
| **Inbox/Chat** | Real-time chat rooms (per project), DMs, AI room (dedicated AI ↔ founder thread), push notifications |
| **Vault** | Files, notes (TipTap editor), links; auto AI-labeling on upload; Google Drive storage backend; approval workflow; activity logs; comments |
| **Vault Viewers** | Monaco code editor (30+ languages), TipTap doc editor, DOCX viewer, spreadsheet viewer (XLSX/CSV), PDF viewer, image viewer |
| **Vault Search** | Chunk-level semantic search (HuggingFace BGE + pgvector), item-level vector search, hybrid search (semantic + keyword), MMR re-ranking, related items panel |
| **Vault RAG** | Injects top-k vault chunks as context into AI prompts, entity grounding, source attribution with chunk previews |
| **AI Command Bar** | MCP-style agentic loop, streaming SSE, 8 action tools + 11 read tools, persistent chat sessions, model routing (fast/std/strong), live tool activity display, confirmation flow |
| **AI Writer (Notes)** | TipTap-integrated AI writer, uses vault RAG context, streams response, inserts directly into editor |
| **AI Code Assistant** | Monaco-integrated AI panel, vault RAG context for code, suggestions (add types, error handling, JSDoc, refactor), append/replace modes |
| **AI Workspace Intelligence** | Risk detection (overdue, blocked, stale deals, overloaded members, at-risk projects), priority engine, bottleneck detection, team load analysis |
| **AI Proactive Mode** | Morning briefing, EOD summary, real-time risk alerts, configurable mode (quiet/balanced/aggressive), push notifications |
| **AI Memory** | Learns patterns (preferred assignee per project, preferred bucket), stores preferences/workflows, injects into AI context |
| **Gmail Integration** | Full thread view, AI analysis (intent, sentiment, urgency, signals), lead score auto-update, CRM stage auto-advancement, auto task creation from email action items, auto lead detection from inbox |
| **Meeting Recorder** | Desktop (Electron) audio capture (mic + system), Groq Whisper transcription, AI meeting analysis, auto task creation, decision vault notes, CRM stage updates from participants, AI inbox notification |
| **LinkedIn View** | LinkedIn integration panel |
| **Push Notifications** | Web push for inbox messages, meeting reminders, AI briefings |

---

## Pricing Tiers

### 🆓 Free — "Get Started"
*Target: Solo founders and freelancers testing the product*
*Seats: 1 founder + up to 2 team members*

#### ✅ Included
**Productivity Core**
- Task management with all 4 buckets (Today / This Week / Delegated / Backlog)
- Up to 3 active projects
- Basic calendar (manual events only, no Google Sync)
- Today View & Dashboard

**Teams** *(limited)*
- Up to 2 team member seats
- Task assignment and delegation
- Basic team workload view

**Client Portal** *(limited)*
- Up to 3 active clients
- Client task view + client home
- Client file uploads folder
- Deliverables sharing with approval flow
- "Powered by Kobin AI" badge on portal

**Vault** *(limited)*
- Up to 2GB storage
- File uploads (all types), notes, link saving
- Basic AI auto-labeling on upload
- No semantic search

**Inbox/Chat**
- Project chat rooms (up to 3 rooms matching project limit)
- Direct messages

#### ❌ Not Included
- AI Command Bar
- Vault semantic/RAG search
- AI Writer & Code Assistant
- Gmail integration
- Meeting Recorder
- Proactive AI (briefings, EOD, alerts)
- AI Memory
- CRM Pipeline
- Google Calendar sync + Meet links
- LinkedIn View
- Push Notifications

---

### 🚀 Pro — "Scale Your Practice"
*Target: Growing agencies and teams actively selling and delivering*
*Price: ~$29 / seat / month (billed annually)*
*Seats: Unlimited (billed per seat)*

#### Everything in Free, plus:

**Unlimited**
- Unlimited projects and active clients
- Unlimited team seats
- 50GB Vault storage
- No "Powered by Kobin AI" badge — use your own logo

**Google Integration**
- Full Google Calendar sync
- Auto-generated Google Meet links on every scheduled meeting
- Google Drive as Vault backend (files stored in your Drive)

**CRM Pipeline**
- Full 7-stage sales pipeline
- Lead scores (0–100) and deal values
- Close probability % and weighted pipeline
- Stale deal detection (14+ days in stage)

**Gmail Intelligence**
- Gmail thread viewing
- AI email analysis: intent, sentiment, urgency
- Lead score auto-update from emails
- Auto CRM stage advancement
- Auto task creation from email action items

**AI Command Bar** *(standard tools only)*
- All 8 action tools: create/update/delete tasks, create/update projects, update CRM deal stage, send messages, analyze workspace
- All 11 read tools: workspace overview, tasks, projects, team workload, CRM pipeline, calendar, vault files, contacts search, meeting notes
- Persistent sessions
- Standard model tier

**Vault AI Search**
- Hybrid semantic + keyword search
- Item-level vector similarity
- Related documents panel

**AI Workspace Intelligence**
- Risk detection dashboard (overdue, blocked, stale)
- Team load analysis
- Priority engine
- Bottleneck alerts

**Push Notifications**
- Inbox message notifications
- Meeting reminders
- Risk alerts

#### ❌ Still Locked (Agency tier)
- Vault RAG (AI with vault context)
- AI Writer (notes + code assistant)
- Chunk-level semantic search with MMR
- AI Proactive Mode (morning briefings, EOD summaries)
- AI Memory system
- Meeting Recorder (Whisper transcription + AI analysis)
- Auto lead detection from Gmail
- White-label client portal (custom domain)

---

### 🏢 Agency — "Your AI-Powered Ops Layer"
*Target: Established agencies running 10+ clients, with complex delivery workflows*
*Price: ~$79 / seat / month (billed annually)*
*Seats: Unlimited (billed per seat)*

#### Everything in Pro, plus:

**The AI Core — The Big Differentiators**

| Feature | What it Does |
|---|---|
| **Vault RAG** | AI answers questions using your actual vault documents as context. Chunk-level retrieval, entity grounding, MMR re-ranking, source attribution. NotebookLM-level for your agency. |
| **AI Writer (Notes)** | Write SOPs, proposals, briefs with AI assistance — context-aware using your vault. Streams directly into the TipTap editor. |
| **AI Code Assistant** | Monaco editor with AI panel inside your code files. Vault-aware: AI uses your codebase as context. Suggest types, refactors, error handling, docs. |
| **Vault Semantic Search** | Chunk-level pgvector search across ALL document content (not just titles/descriptions). Full document text indexed and searchable. |
| **AI Proactive Mode** | Morning briefing delivered to inbox daily. EOD summary auto-generated. Real-time risk alerts pushed to phone. Configurable: Quiet / Balanced / Aggressive. |
| **AI Memory** | AI learns your patterns — who you usually assign to which project, what bucket you prefer. Gets smarter over time. |
| **Meeting Recorder** | Desktop app captures mic + system audio. Groq Whisper transcription. AI creates tasks, logs decisions to vault, updates CRM, notifies you in inbox. Auto-record toggle. |
| **Auto Lead Detection** | Gmail webhook detects new emails from unknown senders. AI classifies: is this a business lead? If yes, auto-adds to CRM pipeline. Filters out newsletters, spam, SaaS notifications. |
| **Strong AI Model Routing** | Complex commands (plan, roadmap, analyze, multi-step) automatically routed to strongest model tier. |

**White-Label Client Portal**
- Custom domain (`portal.yourclientcompany.com`)
- Remove all Kobin branding
- Custom logo, colors
- Fully branded experience for each client

**Vault Storage**
- Up to 500GB (or discuss custom)

**AI Command Bar — Full Power**
- Vault semantic search as a tool (`vault_semantic_search`)
- Meeting notes lookup by contact/date/topic
- All model tiers (fast / std / strong) automatically selected

**Priority Support**
- Dedicated onboarding call
- Priority Slack/email support queue

---

## Why This Structure Works

### Free → Hooks whole teams
Client portal + team seats for free means clients experience the product too. Switching cost builds immediately as files, tasks, and chat live inside Kobin.

### Pro → Driven by integrations
Once a team hits the seat limit or needs their Gmail/CRM/calendar connected, the upgrade is a no-brainer. The CRM + Gmail combo alone is worth the price.

### Agency → Driven by AI depth
The Vault RAG + AI Writer + Meeting Recorder combo is your real moat. No other PM tool has this. A NotebookLM-level knowledge base combined with a code assistant, meeting intelligence, and proactive briefings — that's a category unto itself. Larger agencies will pay premium to run their entire ops layer through Kobin.

---

## What to Gate Carefully

> [!IMPORTANT]
> These three features are the most technically impressive and should be **Agency-only anchors**. Do not include them in Pro.
> 1. **Vault RAG** — This is what makes Kobin "NotebookLM for agencies." Giving it free kills the upsell.
> 2. **AI Proactive Mode** — Morning briefings feel magical. Save it. Tease it in Pro UI ("Upgrade to enable AI briefings").
> 3. **Meeting Recorder** — A complete differentiator. Only Agency should get Whisper transcription + AI meeting analysis.

> [!TIP]
> **Teaser tactic:** On Pro, show the AI Writer button in the vault but disable it with an "Agency feature" tooltip. Users who discover it will convert.

